author zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790603718 +0900
committer zichuanxu <zichuanxu28@gmail.com> 1790603718 +0900

Add Mem0 and Graphiti adapters and .mem export/import; add matplotlib

native.py: Mem0 (Qdrant path mode, SQLite history, raw records archived
under a separate scope so the configuration stays identifiable) and
Graphiti (embedded Kuzu) through their own ingestion paths with our
OpenAI-compatible endpoints; idempotent ingest per object revision,
snapshot/restore, packed serving under the shared reader budget, raw
export for black-box (D,B) inference. mem_export.py: HoldMem to Portable
Memory bundles with and without a derivation record, a second HoldMem
importer, Mem0 import, and a round-trip probe of which carriers survive.
Observed with portable-memory 0.3.0: the derivation record survives as a
custom kind or in episode ext (48/48) but fact ext is dropped on import
(0/48). The run image now includes the native extra and matplotlib.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
